message: "If you use this software or the dataset it publishes, please cite it as below."
title: "US tech job postings pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A daily pipeline that collects open jobs at about 1,500 US tech companies from their
  public Greenhouse, Lever and Ashby job boards, models them in DuckDB and dbt
  (staging, history, marts with enforced contracts) and publishes a daily dataset,
  summary files and a dashboard.
